														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2536587">
									

<p>This was a very enjoyable tale. The ending felt the tiniest bit flat, perhaps partly in the description of the anomaly itself (which is very straightforward), but I did like how it paid off some earlier moments - I think this will hold up well on a second read. And everything leading up to the ending was engaging and kept moving forward well. While the narrator's character was (for obvious reasons) not fully fleshed-out, putting us inside his head worked well, and I'm a sucker for stories that begin in medias res.</p>
<p>Finally, the description of the physical effects of amnestics is going straight into my headcanon, as is BACE. Well done.</p>

							</div>

								
					
